550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Change Cash Bonus Payout Frequency You shall have the option to change the Cash Bonus payout frequency. You can choose to receive these payouts on a monthly/ quarterly/ half-yearly/ annual basis. This change will be applicable from the next policy anniversary only. Once such a request has been raised, the next request can be raised only after 90 days from the previous request.)
/E (Change Cash Bonus Payout Frequency You shall have the option to change the Cash Bonus payout frequency. You can choose to receive these payouts on a monthly/ quarterly/ half-yearly/ annual basis. This change will be applicable from the next policy anniversary only. Once such a request has been raised, the next request can be raised only after 90 days from the previous request.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
551 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Choose To Get Cash Bonus On A Special Date You can also choose to receive the Cash Bonus \(if any\) payout on any particular date other than the policy anniversary. This option should be selected at the time of making proposal and is only available if you select annual cash bonus frequency. This date will no longer be effective if you switch to any other cash bonus frequency later during the Policy Term.  In such a case, the Cash Bonus applicable for first policy year when it is due, would be calculated by pro-rating the annual rate by the number of days between the date of inception of the policy and the special date chosen by you. All future Cash Bonuses shall be payable on the chosen special date and shall be of the original amount except for the last policy year where it would be calculated by pro-rating the annual rate by the number of days between the special date and date of maturity.)
/E (Choose To Get Cash Bonus On A Special Date You can also choose to receive the Cash Bonus \(if any\) payout on any particular date other than the policy anniversary. This option should be selected at the time of making proposal and is only available if you select annual cash bonus frequency. This date will no longer be effective if you switch to any other cash bonus frequency later during the Policy Term.  In such a case, the Cash Bonus applicable for first policy year when it is due, would be calculated by pro-rating the annual rate by the number of days between the date of inception of the policy and the special date chosen by you. All future Cash Bonuses shall be payable on the chosen special date and shall be of the original amount except for the last policy year where it would be calculated by pro-rating the annual rate by the number of days between the special date and date of maturity.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
552 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Tax Benefits Tax benefit may be available as per prevailing tax laws. It is recommended that you obtain professional advice for applicability of Income Tax benefit on premiums paid and benefits received. Income Tax, if any, will be deducted at the applicable rate from the payments made under the Policy. Goods & Services Tax, Cess \(if any\) and any other Statutory levy will be charged extra on premiums as per prevailing rates. Tax laws are subject to amendments from time to time.  The Company does not assume responsibility on tax implication mentioned anywhere in this document.)
/E (Tax Benefits Tax benefit may be available as per prevailing tax laws. It is recommended that you obtain professional advice for applicability of Income Tax benefit on premiums paid and benefits received. Income Tax, if any, will be deducted at the applicable rate from the payments made under the Policy. Goods & Services Tax, Cess \(if any\) and any other Statutory levy will be charged extra on premiums as per prevailing rates. Tax laws are subject to amendments from time to time.  The Company does not assume responsibility on tax implication mentioned anywhere in this document.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
